<title>USA: TABLE- KCS Q2 net and oper shr drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE- KCS Q2 net and oper shr drops.</headline>
<dateline>EDISON, N.J. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.08		    $0.23</p>
<p> Shr			   0.08		     0.21</p>
<p> Net			  2,292		    4,987</p>
<p> Revs			32,551		   26,098</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,970		   23,790</p>
<p>Six months</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.27		    $0.49</p>
<p> Shr			   0.45		     0.46</p>
<p> Net			 13,086		   10,842</p>
<p> Revs			72,430		   53,382</p>
<p> Avg			 29,021		   32,683</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: KCS Energy Inc's second-quarter 1996 net earnings include a loss of $537,000, or $0.02 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The company's six months 1997 net earnings include a gain of $5.34 million, or $0.18 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>The six-months net earnings for 1996 include a $655,000 loss, or $0.03 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
